      q: "Consider a demand paging system with three frames, and the following page reference string: 1 2 3 4 5 4 1 6 4 5 1 3 2. The contents of the frames are given after each reference, with page-replacement references marked. Which one or more of the following could be the page replacement policy/policies in use?",
